                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "There’s maybe half an hour of actual content in this game. Everything after that is just brutal, mind-numbing grinding. I literally fell asleep several times while playing some of the levels.\r\n\r\nI only pushed through to 100% because of my unhealthy perfectionism and inability to leave something unfinished. I seriously need help...\r\n\r\nI completed the entire game on Steam Deck. On PC, I couldn’t get it to run at all — it crashes almost immediately after launch. At the moment, there doesn’t seem to be a proper solution for this showstopper bug.\r\n\r\nI strongly recommend against purchasing this game.",
